    "body": "Lexend 1.007 is now bundled directly with LEXEDITOR, so it needs no first-run download or system installation. The package includes the complete SIL Open Font License and a pinned source/hash record. The neutral main menu and shared defaults use Lexend; FF8, RDR1, RDR2, and Warband keep their own theme fonts. Hidden Edge confirmed the actual Lexend face loaded instead of a fallback.",
